    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_33829c15",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image features a man in a red striped shirt with a serious, slightly exasperated expression, overlaid with text that reads 'hey this bag only weighs .8' and 'it's graam!'. The joke is a play on the common mispronunciation of 'gram' (a unit of weight) as 'graam', implying the bag is extremely light. The man's expression is used to convey the absurdity or disbelief of the statement. There is no toxicity, harmful content, or hateful intent present. The meme is purely humorous and relies on a pun and visual juxtaposition to create a comedic effect. The intent is to entertain through wordplay and the visual reaction of the person in the image.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_203f476e"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
