      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The meme targets a general internet audience familiar with casual wordplay and internet humor, particularly those who recognize the mispronunciation of 'gram' as 'graam' and appreciate the absurdity of the situation. The target community includes users of internet meme culture who enjoy visual reaction-based humor and linguistic puns.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
